      "sourceCaveats": {
        "1021": "Urgency, two whole days, northeast Xavian temple and Anilia death preserved; Progress unavailable both refs.",
        "1031": "Death narrative, northern arch, dying wish and grief preserved. Current quest Mapper endpoints and NPC3901 g_mapperData at21.8/53.2 support western Shrine; installed Forest Song objective stale. Native/live pending.",
        "1032": "Almost sad ambiguity, request to kill/bring horns,16 horns, kind<race> and sister spirit preserved; same Shrine evidence as1031.",
        "86757": "6 swords/4 daggers bound to supported source aliases. HTML item labels Jagged Orcish Sword/Curved Orcish Dagger are aliases to objective wording, not substituted. Condemnation of violence and conditional invasion preserved.",
        "98069": "8 supplies; west lair at both cliff base and cave top; uncertainty and next shipment preserved.",
        "98070": "5 each of three distinct harpy targets; conditional caravans cease, order kill then return; source objective full Harpies suffix aliases differ linked table singular names.",
        "1135": "10 sacs; west Highperch; raw DeepL females as human collectors corrected to young wyvern/fertile female source. Value and slaughter inference preserved.",
        "1145": "Swarm1 courier: Korran note→Belgrom/Orgrimmar. Field of Giants eggs, outside warriors guild, Warchief/Thrall conditional retained; raw envy mistranslation corrected.",
        "1146": "Swarm2 courier: Belgrom note→Moktar/ThousandNeedles. More than half warparty killed; stay until Belgrom news; racing disdain preserved. Flats short place alias retained.",
        "1147": "Swarm3 kill5each Searchers/HiveDrones/Invaders returnMoktar. South dig; should uncertainty, blade/staff, cannot leave condition, stench/stampede/heat joke retained. Raw monsters mistranslation corrected."
      },
