      "sourceCaveats": {
        "3567": "Service title+Completion only in both English sources andUA. One of twin colossals, send<race>, consider descent, one-way-only warning preserved. No offer/objective/Progress invented.",
        "5421": "Repeatable primary direct-heading Progress plus title+Completion. Secondary detail duplicates primary Progress exactly; not a missing offer. UA offer/objective differ but cannot supply English. Five shellfish→one Bloodbellyfish written count and lazy playful voice retained; shellfish links item13545 in Progress, retained in field.",
        "1104": "6venoms→FizzleBrassbolts; enthusiastic repetition really3times; mixture uncertainty and chemical sequence boil/apply/add preserved, fictitious reagent names retained. ",
        "1105": "9tortoise shells→Wizzle; rawDeepL misidentified tortoises as deer/snakes corrected. Brother age unspecified, neutral sibling used; fuel eats chassis, reinforcebefore, probable benttools joke retained.",
        "1110": "30parts→Kravel; item exacttitle+linked lower-case detail alias retained. Two metal sheets,ear not air,carpilot not aircraft, profiteering from tragedy joke preserved.",
        "1175": "10Basilisks/10Crystalhides/6Gazers→wholeTrackmasterZherin. RedThunder/Kronkrider retained. Avoidkillingontrack hope and shovel complaint preserved.",
        "1176": "10bones→Pozzik; vulture species corrected from rawDeepL inventedbirdguts. Power/coils/frame, strength/weight balance, waitforpartscondition retained.",
        "1179": "Exactquest1179Alliance ownside1, UA Both label obsolete; neighboring2769same-title row excluded. WholeBrassbolts/Wizzle identities, linkedcrate item, SiegeEnginehelmets, southcanyon and gnomebrothers, concussions and reluctantpilot joke retained.",
        "1106": "preQuestGroup12=[1104,1105],nextS22=1108; not preQuestSingle. ProperMartek title+rankwhole and DuchessPamay whole retained. FizzleLetter sourcealias vs linkedFizzleBrassboltsLetter. RawDeepL inverted dontwantmedead corrected; pistonsnot hardenough polarity corrected on reread; axe not sword; suspicious NPC then helpful shift preserved.",
        "1178": "SpeakGazloweRatchet after1176; Progress unavailable. Goblin sponsorship rivalry, lateprototype, oneofmostrespected, two-engine model (not two different engine models), uncertainbusinessharm and TinkersUnion retained."
      },
